---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<Base title="About" description="Silent Power is an independent project by Yod Mem making the Tao Te Ching accessible without making it shallow.">
<section><div class="wrap narrow prose"><div class="label">About</div><h1>Silent Power</h1>
<p>Silent Power is an independent project by Yod Mem. It began as videos on the Tao Te Ching and grew into books, music and a growing library of short essays.</p>
<p>The aim is simple: make the Tao accessible without making it shallow. Plain language, no mystical performance, and enough depth that the old ideas can still surprise you.</p>
<p>Questions or feedback: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></p>
</div></section></Base>
